26:43.720 --> 26:45.680
Para leluhur,

26:50.440 --> 26:51.590
Kakak Keenam,

26:52.480 --> 26:53.680
Kakak Ketujuh,

26:54.720 --> 26:56.000
Kakak Ipar Ketujuh,

26:57.000 --> 26:58.270
